<p>Make a melee attack dealing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">144%, 163%, 177%, 189%, 200%</acronym> weapon damage and attempt to snatch a foe that has 20% life or less left and swallow it whole.</p><p>While you digest it you gain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 1, 2, 2, 3</acronym> insanity per turn.</p><p>The digestion lasts for 50 turns for an elite and 25 turns for others.</p><p>This effect's remaining duration only goes down while in combat, and its bonuses are only applied while in combat.</p>